<title>HUNGARY: Hungary jobless rate falls to 10.6 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Hungary jobless rate falls to 10.6 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployment rate fell to 10.6 percent in November from 10.8 percent in October, the National Labor Centre (OMK) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    HUNGARY JOBLESS	   Nov 96     Oct96    Nov 95</p>
<p>    registered unemployed   484,500   494,900   484,617</p>
<p>    rate (pct)		   10.6	10.8	10.2</p>
<p>NOTE - All percentage figures are based on size of the active population in January 1995.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
